WEBVTT

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.690
Light and Darkness.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.540
The final battle of the gods
climaxed in a clash between...

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.750
Marfa, Goddess of All Creation,
and Kardis, Goddess of Destruction.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.550
At the end of their fierce
battle, the stricken goddesses...

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:27.150
had split the continent,
forming a new land.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.570
Since then, people have come
to call this new continent...

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:36.010
"Lodoss - The Accursed Island."

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:17.020
After saving Princess Fianna from
the mysterious witch, Karla...

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:21.120
Parn and his friends are
welcomed in Valis as heroes.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:30.570
Indeed, it is here that their
cursed destiny truly begins.

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:35.470
You are here as
my daughter's benefactors.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:39.090
Come now,
raise your heads.

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:41.840
No, majesty. We cannot.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:46.950
Fianna's return has allowed me
to learn the war situation.

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:48.490
Please.

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:06.370
You there.
What is your name, lad?

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:09.800
Parn, your majesty.

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:10.870
Parn.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.050
Lord Kashue, look there!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.670
Damned beasts!

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:53.820
Calm down!

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:56.040
Look closely!

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.510
Why...
It's Prince Jester!

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:07.090
I pity your horses,
having to run all the way to Valis.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:10.350
Are you going
to be flying far?

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:14.770
Up to the northern border!
With Mycen.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.650
I see.

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:20.120
When next we meet,
we'll raise a cup together!

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:25.320
The kingdom of Moss
is moving as well.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.510
Whoa! Whoa!

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:02.710
Who are you?!

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:05.240
My name is Karla.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:08.740
Karla? And what do
you want with me?!

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:12.050
Perhaps to give you Lodoss?

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:13.870
What?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.220
Whoa, now! Easy boy.

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:42.530
Did something happen,
M'lord?

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:43.820
No.

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:47.780
Right, let's go!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.710
You'd never guess a
war was about to start.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:09.320
All to raise their morale,
I'd dare say.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.020
Parn! Deed!

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:24.780
I've never worn anything
like this. Well?

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:28.030
You both look splendid.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:32.220
I only wish dear Etoh here
would have changed as well.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:35.790
I... I couldn't!
I'm a cleric, after all!

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:40.290
Do they really teach you to never
take off your priest's robes?

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:49.790
Ghim.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:56.810
Something wrong?

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:00.230
Ghim?

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:07.650
Never mind me. Just had
a little too much to drink.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:14.250
Six lights had gathered,
evermore known as the Six Heroes

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:19.330
One of them a knight,
in white armor with a holy sword

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:24.100
Now king of Valis,
his name was Fahn

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:27.070
One of them a knight,
whose heart was stolen

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:28.870
in the conquest
of the Demon

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:33.000
The emperor of Marmo,
his name was Beld

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:37.950
One of them a dwarf, final
ruler of the Kingdom of Stone

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:42.390
Never to be forgotten,
his name was Fleve.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:46.550
One of them a sorcerer,
a fountainhead of knowledge

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.900
The great sage of Moss,
his name was Wort

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:56.020
One of them a cleric of Marfa,
protector of our motherland

00:07:56.900 --> 00:08:00.690
A priestess,
her name was Neese

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:04.930
The final one,
a warrior of magic

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:11.420
The only light who
had not a name to give

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:24.060
It's King Kashue!

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:36.720
Hey, who is he?

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:40.750
Kashue Arnague the First,
king of Flaim.

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.500
Him?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.890
Yeah.
The mercenary king who...

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:48.460
united the desert kingdom
of Flaim with only his sword.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:18.490
So, these are the famed
border guards of Valis, eh?

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:27.000
Attack!

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:33.920
The Marmo!

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:56.400
May we soon meet again...

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.910
Under Falis'
divine protection.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:03.870
What's that ornament on
your forehead made from?

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.830
It's <i>so</i> beautiful!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.980
Oh, what a bother!

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:23.040
It's tiring, just laughing
at nothing all the time.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:40.130
I can barely move
in this gown. Look!

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:43.290
Why do humans like
these things so much?

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:48.680
My normal clothes
are much better, right?

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.970
Right, Parn?

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:57.340
PARN!

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:00.890
What's wrong, Deed?

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.430
Never mind!

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.230
Hey... Wait!
Deed!

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:11.690
Sorry boys!

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:14.260
Guess today's
just my lucky day!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.670
Okay.

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.750
Round they go,
their fate to give...

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:22.910
the gambler either
a win or a loss!

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:27.980
I'd better go.

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:30.420
Quitting while
you're ahead, pal?

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:34.370
I just think I should
get back to the dungeon.

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:39.170
A hardworking jailer, huh?
I won't miss YOU, then!

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.940
Hey, say hi
to Naba for me.

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:45.120
I will, while his head's still on
good terms with the rest of him!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.430
Naba?

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:50.430
What'd this
"Naba" guy do?

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:53.480
Killed his superior.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.440
It's all because
he's such a mean drunk.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:12:00.800
He got so wild that his
commander tried to stop him.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:04.330
Beat the poor bastard to death
without even thinking about it.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:04.950
Yeah.

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:09.700
Well, let's go!

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.150
You dirty...!

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.920
Uh-oh.

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.130
Ka... shue...

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:01.780
Kashue...!

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:32.560
Guess they don't teach dancing
at the monastery, either.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:48.310
Isn't Kashue wonderful?

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:52.850
As skilled at dance as
he is with the sword.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.150
Parn!

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:01.610
We're dancing!

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.580
Huh? H-h-hey!

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:05.500
No! I...!

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:08.830
Wait! I can't...!

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:12.580
Don't worry.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:15.930
I'll lead.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:19.580
Just relax,
and take it slowly.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.590
Uh... okay.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:32.050
Kashue.

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:36.390
Ow... They really let me
have it. God dammit!

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.550
Kashue...!

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:46.330
Who's...?

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.200
Easy, just relax.

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:54.120
Slowly, slowly.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:57.120
There we go,
you've got it!

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.630
Excuse us!

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:13.680
King Kashue!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:17.810
Ah, our brave
hero is so young?

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:21.900
I believe you
came here to fight?

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.090
Yes, sir!

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.390
Ghim.

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.730
Hurry!
Protect King Fahn!

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.860
Kashue.

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:13.820
Kashue!

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:21.580
Parn!

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.020
Use this!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.760
Kashue!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.990
Ow-ow-ow-ow!

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:04.820
Can't Falis take
it easy on me?!

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:07.440
Falis has other
things to worry about.

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:09.880
Parn! Oh...?

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:13.840
He's training.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:16.640
He's been drinking in
the war fever around here.

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:17.640
Oh.

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:35.060
Don't swing with your shoulders!
Use the strength in your hips!

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:59.180
My lord Kashue.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:00.950
You!

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.400
You know her?

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:05.340
Highness, she's the witch who
tried to kidnap Princess Fianna.

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:06.180
What?

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:11.150
Did you enjoy my little
diversion, my lord?

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:14.470
That man, you mean?

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:18.910
Let me help you.
For the sake of all Lodoss.

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:20.910
For Lodoss?!

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:23.910
Begone!

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:31.000
Very well then.

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:36.320
But take care that you
aren't murdered in your sleep.

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:40.720
My great lord
mercenary, Kashue.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:57.450
She's gone!

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:03.450
What was...

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:09.450
He's here!

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:17.960
I am Prince Jester!
I must see King Fahn at once!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:58.340
Now then, Parn. You say their
army isn't just made up of humans?

00:19:58.650 --> 00:19:59.470
Yes, sir.

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:05.080
We can confirm that as well.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:08.050
The northern border has fallen.

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:10.140
It can't be!

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:13.600
We'd best face the
situation calmly.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:17.510
At first light,
we must send reinforcements.

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:18.540
Aye!

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:23.890
Then we will help make sure
the Valis garrison is fully manned.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:25.400
Our thanks to you.

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:30.950
Sire, there is another
matter of concern.

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:35.670
Karla.

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:38.400
Yes, sire.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.270
This witch, Karla,
is known to the Marmo.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:45.090
Her true intentions
are inscrutable to us.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:54.900
Karla... That same name is mentioned
in the legends of the Kingdom of Sorcery.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.240
A legendary witch?

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:59.160
Whatever the case may be...

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:02.290
we'd do well to have someone
investigate her more fully.

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:08.890
The sage, Wort, may know
something about her.

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:10.320
Wort?

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:16.200
But who would
travel that distance?

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:20.420
The path isn't
safe by any means.

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.510
I have a suggestion, sire.

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:30.960
What?

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:35.230
For this task, I think Parn
would be most suitable.

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:54.250
Very soon now.

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:05.830
The Demon Sword
senses it as well!

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:08.360
All Lodoss
kneels before me!

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:16.470
Fahn.

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:43.730
Beld.

00:22:55.450 --> 00:22:58.490
Holy Sword calls
out to Demon Sword.

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:02.360
Lodoss is swept by a
battle for its destiny.

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:05.890
Can a new light take hold
in this murderous land?

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:08.610
Next time,
on Record of Lodoss War:

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:11.580
Episode 6 -
"The Sword of the Dark Emperor"

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:15.060
I will defend the peace
of Lodoss with my life!
